 modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":216166,"global_rank":257502,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":43639},{"name":"jacksonwelsh/raspi-wifilights","owner":"jacksonwelsh","html_url":"https://github.com/jacksonwelsh/raspi-wifilights","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216163,"global_rank":257504,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":43640},{"name":"kevinlin311tw/CSE517-language-models","owner":"kevinlin311tw","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinlin311tw/CSE517-language-models","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216163,"global_rank":257505,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":43641},{"name":"Harshit-Shrivastava/Search","owner":"Harshit-Shrivastava","html_url":"https://github.com/Harshit-Shrivastava/Search","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":["artificial-intelligence","machine-learning","optmization","search-algorithm"],"score":216163,"global_rank":257513,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":43642},{"name":"davisagli/Products.RelationIndex","owner":"davisagli","html_url":"https://github.com/davisagli/Products.RelationIndex","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"ZCatalog index of object relations","topics":[],"score":216162,"global_rank":257514,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":43643},{"name":"matsengrp/bioboxmixcr","owner":"matsengrp